        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2502.11018">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2502.11018">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2502.11018">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
